{
  "id": "section-mission-table-continued",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mission table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,22,41]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,41,43]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Medical Supplies. A loved one is in need for specific medicines. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,43,112]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gain 3 XP as soon as you return to your starting box with 3 doses of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,112,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the required medicines. You have a 1 in 6 of finding 1 “dose” every\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,181,249]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "time you roll on a House or Lab box, and a 3 in 6 every time you visit\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,249,320]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a Clinic box. If you have visited all boxes and didn’t find any, you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,320,394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically find 3 doses in the last box you visit.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,394,448]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,448,450]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Predator and Prey. You must defeat a random slasher from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,450,511]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "slasher table. You must spend a number of Clues equal to the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,511,572]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "slasher’s level to locate your target in the next box you enter. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,572,640]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you meet ANY slasher through a random roll, there is a 4 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,640,702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance that you encounter exactly the one you are hunting. Once\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,702,766]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have defeated the slasher and returned to your starting\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,766,826]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "location OR to any Safe House, you gain 5 XP or 2 rolls on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,826,889]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Useful Stuff table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,889,909]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,909,911]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Bring Home the Bacon . You must bring back to your starting\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,911,971]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "location a large quantity (2d6+12) of Food. This is IN ADDITION to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,971,1038]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any Food points currently on your character’s sheet. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1038,1095]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically are given a backpack if desired, and you may leave\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1095,1160]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any of your items in your starting box (or in any Safe House) in order\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1160,1231]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to have more space to carry Food. You have a 3 in 6 chance of finding\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1231,1301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 Food points every time you visit a location from the Street, Store\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1301,1371]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or Farm tables. Once you return to your starting box with the Food,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1371,1439]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Food is given to the local survivors and you gain 3 XP OR 3 rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1439,1509]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Useful Stuff table, your choice. You may also keep the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1509,1571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "backpack.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[40,1571,1581]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Mission table (d6, continued)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,22,52]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,52,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "We Need Weapons. You must explore the town and bring back to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,54,115]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your starting box firearms (pistols, rifles, shotguns). When you do\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,115,183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so, you gain 1 XP per every firearm with at least 6 ammo, with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,183,248]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "maximum gain of 5 XP. You may alter the Town Exploration roll by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,248,313]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+1 or -1 if this lets you reach a Military Installation or a Store.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,313,381]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,381,383]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Destroy the Coven. You must defeat 5 witches hiding in town. To\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,383,447]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find a witch, when you enter a new box you must spend 3 Clues.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,447,510]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Spend just 2 Clues if you have the Investigator Skill, and 1 Clue if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,510,579]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have Investigator (Expert). If you do not have enough Clues,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,579,644]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll for the random content of that box as usual. You will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,644,703]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically meet a witch in any of the last 5 locations that you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,703,770]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "visit on your town map, but if you did not discover them by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,770,830]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spending Clues, they will have a 5 in 6 chance of surprising you. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,830,899]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you want, you may spend 1 or more Clues to reduce this chance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,899,961]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of surprise by 1 for every Clue spent. Also your Danger Sense Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,961,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will reduce their chance of surprising you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1029,1073]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you take a witch alive (attacking her in hand-to-hand combat at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1073,1140]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "-2 inflicting non-lethal damage, or defeating her with the book of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1140,1207]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Hypnos or the Hand of Glory), you gain 1 Clue that you may use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1207,1270]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ONLY to find the next witch.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1270,1299]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Witches are L4 humans, 4 Life. Each turn you are in combat with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1299,1365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "witch, you must perform a L5 Will save (lose 1 Sanity if you fail).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1365,1433]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You gain 1 XP every time you defeat a witch and 2 XP and 1 item\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1433,1497]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the Useful Stuff table (roll three times and pick the best\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1497,1561]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "result) when you defeat the last one.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1561,1599]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1599,1601]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Close a Hell Gate. This is the default activity of the campaign. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1601,1670]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may always attempt this even during other missions, because\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1670,1730]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "closing 7 gates over the course of a campaign completes the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1730,1790]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "campaign and ends the game in a victory. When you play this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1790,1850]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mission, if you do not find any hell gate through random rolls, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1850,1918]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will find one automatically after 12+d6 boxes, and another one in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1918,1984]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-mission-table-continued:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the 30th box that you visit.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[41,1984,2012]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    40,
    41
  ]
}
